+Wickborn Arena ($WICKB) is a 3D creature/tower battle game with a stock-token-inspired frontend roster. Build an eight-card deck from twelve token-inspired fighters, destroy side towers to gain deployment territory, and defeat the central tower or lead after 150 seconds.
 
